From a8f0b2547d70275ebf956ede8de230f6121336e6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Annachiara Gallo <annachiara.gallo@amarulasolutions.com>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 09:48:13 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] rk_avb_ops_user.c: Only update indexes if slot successful

Rockchip index updating always writes the greater index in vbmeta's
header during android_slot_verify().
Leverage upgrade_available U-Boot environment variable set by
mender-update tp only update indexes if mender has reached the
Commit phase and rebooted, allowing rollback to the idle partiton
even in case of index increase.

This is a temporary solution since upgrade_available is not
protected.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [oe-specific]
Signed-off-by: Annachiara Gallo <annachiara.gallo@amarulasolutions.com>
---
 lib/avb/rk_avb_user/rk_avb_ops_user.c | 9 +++++++++
 1 file changed, 9 insertions(+)

diff --git a/lib/avb/rk_avb_user/rk_avb_ops_user.c b/lib/avb/rk_avb_user/rk_avb_ops_user.c
index 78e0d9aa5f..262d9878c5 100644
--- a/lib/avb/rk_avb_user/rk_avb_ops_user.c
+++ b/lib/avb/rk_avb_user/rk_avb_ops_user.c
@@ -825,6 +825,15 @@ int rk_avb_update_stored_rollback_indexes_for_slot(AvbOps* ops, AvbSlotVerifyDat
 	uint64_t current_stored_rollback_index;
 	AvbIOResult io_ret;
 
+	/* Only update secure storage with new rollback index if:
+	 *
+	 * - We are in a rollback reboot (mender-update failed and triggered rollback)
+	 * - We are in a >= second reboot after mender install (mender-update succeeded and committed)
+	 * - We are in the image flashed in MaskROM mode case (upgrade_available does not exist, defaults to 0) */
+	if (env_get_ulong("upgrade_available", 10, 0) != 0){
+		return 0;
+	}
+
 	if (rollback_index > 0) {
 		io_ret = ops->read_rollback_index(ops, 0, &current_stored_rollback_index);
 		if (io_ret != AVB_IO_RESULT_OK)
